# Control-channel script for this app's sim row (sim-run.sh::run_test) on the
# four-button board: every stock value widget driven by UP (19), DOWN (20),
# SELECT (23) and BACK (4). `wait <regex>` blocks until the log matches; every
# other line goes to the simulator's control channel, the verbs `pdb input`
# takes on hardware.
wait KeyNav[]:] ready
# The SeekBar has the focus: SELECT edits it, UP is +1 twice, SELECT commits.
input keyevent 23
input keyevent 19
wait KeyNav[]:] seek 51
input keyevent 19
wait KeyNav[]:] seek 52
input keyevent 23
# DOWN to the Spinner: SELECT opens its list, DOWN moves to Green, SELECT picks it.
input keyevent 20
input keyevent 23
input keyevent 20
input keyevent 23
wait KeyNav[]:] spinner 1
# DOWN to the hour roller: SELECT edits, DOWN is 13, SELECT commits.
input keyevent 20
input keyevent 23
input keyevent 20
wait KeyNav[]:] time 13:30
input keyevent 23
# Past the minute roller to the clickable text, focusable because it is
# clickable: SELECT opens the list dialog, DOWN moves to Green, SELECT picks it.
input keyevent 20
input keyevent 20
input keyevent 23
input keyevent 20
input keyevent 23
wait KeyNav[]:] picked 1
# DOWN to Done and press it.
input keyevent 20
input keyevent 23
wait KeyNav[]:] done
